{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/roca-afanitica",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "fine grained igneous rock",
    "es": "roca afanítica"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Igneous rock in which the framework of the rock consists of crystals that are too small to determine mineralogy with the unaided eye; framework may include up to 50 percent glass. a significant percentage of the rock by volume may be phenocrysts. includes rocks that are generally called volcanic rocks.",
    "es": "Roca ígnea de matriz formada por cristales tan pequeños que no permiten su determinación mineralógica a simple vista; la pasta puede contener más de un 50 por ciento de vidrio. un porcentaje significativo de la roca pueden ser fenocristales. incluye a las rocas que generalmente se denominan volcánicas."
  },
  "narrower": [
    {
      "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/andesita",
      "prefLabel": {
        "en": "andesite",
        "es": "andesita"
      }
    },
    {
